You have to put the "WiiMote Tester" folder in your "apps" folder in the sd card of your Wii. You'll see WiiMote Tester in the homebrew channel.
There's even the wad file of this app, it's included in the compressed zip folder, you can install it in your Wii with a wad installer tool like Wii Mode Lite or YAWM.
**DO NOT INSTALL THE SOURCE ZIP FOLDER.
PLEASE DOWNLOAD ONLY THE RELEASE ZIP FOLDER "wiimote-tester-1.0.0.zip"**
